  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- New analyzer rule FFS0057 prohibits redundant null guards (ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull and if-null-throw checks) on non-nullable references in nullable-enabled code; benchmark tests now run in-process on net11.0 using a shared test collection with allocation ceilings unchanged (#472)\n### Fixed\n- FFS0031 - Cover target-typed new, return types, primary constructors and other shapes with tests (#509)\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.342\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.166.2629\n- ProhibitedMethodsDiagnosticsAnalyzer - added tests for null-conditional, aliased, same-named and other receiver shapes, and fixed detected gaps - #505",
